OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FMike Prickett has a passion for
OL,7,     Ffilming big-wave surfers. But
OL,8,     Fafter he was paralysed saving
OL,9,     Fanother man's life, he found new
OL,10,     Fways to capture the drama of the
OL,11,     Focean.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 2004, the world's first team of
OL,14,     Fmine-detecting rats passed
OL,15,     Faccreditation tests, opening the
OL,16,     Fway for them to be used in
OL,17,     Fhumanitarian demining operations.
